<div id="ice-container"><div class="contract-reader-page contract-reader-page-load print-contract false"><div id="staticDialogDocumentId" style="display: none;"></div><div class="legal-bot-form-item has-success deep-form-field deep-contract-editor-field"><div class="legal-bot-form-item-control"><div class="deep-contract-ding-editor"><div class="contract-ding-editor-upload-file upload-file-hidden"><img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," data-aplus-clk="" /><span>导入本地文件成为在线合同文本</span><input type="file" accept=".doc,.docx" style="visibility: hidden; width: 0px; height: 0px;" data-aplus-clk="" /></div><div class="deep-contract-ding-editor-content false"><div class="contract-ding-editor-directory"></div><div class="
              deep-contract-ding-editor-content-main 
              
              
              "><div class="deep-contract-ding-reader-content contract-ding-editor-content-side-bar"><div class="deep-ding-reader " id="ddReader"><article data-cangjie-content="true" data-zoom="1" style="position: relative; white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; cursor: text; user-select: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow: hidden; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, STHeiti, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 11pt; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;"><div data-cangjie-key="0" data-cangjie-editable="true"><div data-cangjie-leaf-block="true"><div data-cangjie-key="1" step="" data-type="paragraph" class="sc-cJbhSk kWACbk" style="text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; line-height: 2.5;"><span><span><span data-cangjie-key="3:0" data-cangjie-leaf="true" data-testid="3:0" data-cangjie-mark="true" style="font-weight: bold; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;">Legal&nbsp;Statement</span></span></span></div></div><div data-cangjie-leaf-block="true"><div data-cangjie-key="4" step="" data-type="paragraph" class="sc-cJbhSk kWACbk" style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; line-height: 2.5;"><span><span><span data-cangjie-key="6:0" data-cangjie-leaf="true" data-testid="6:0" data-cangjie-mark="true" style="font-weight: bold; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;">Ownership</span></span></span></div></div><div data-cangjie-leaf-block="true"><div data-cangjie-key="7" step="" data-type="paragraph" class="sc-cJbhSk kWACbk" style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; line-height: 2.5;"><span><span data-cangjie-key="9:0" data-cangjie-leaf="true" data-testid="9:0" data-cangjie-mark="true" style="font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;">Unless&nbsp;Taobao&nbsp;and&nbsp;Tmall&nbsp;(hereinafter&nbsp;referred&nbsp;to&nbsp;as&nbsp;"we")&nbsp;have&nbsp;stated&nbsp;separately&nbsp;all&nbsp;rights&nbsp;(including&nbsp;copyright,&nbsp;trademark,&nbsp;patent,&nbsp;trade&nbsp;secret&nbsp;and&nbsp;other&nbsp;related&nbsp;rights)&nbsp;of&nbsp;all&nbsp;official&nbsp;products,&nbsp;technologies,&nbsp;software,&nbsp;programs,&nbsp;data&nbsp;and&nbsp;other&nbsp;information&nbsp;(including&nbsp;text,&nbsp;icons,&nbsp;images,&nbsp;photos,&nbsp;audio,&nbsp;video,&nbsp;graphics,&nbsp;color&nbsp;combinations,&nbsp;layout&nbsp;design,&nbsp;etc.)&nbsp;launched&nbsp;by&nbsp;us&nbsp;belong&nbsp;to&nbsp;Alibaba&nbsp;Group&nbsp;and/or&nbsp;its&nbsp;affiliates.&nbsp;Without&nbsp;the&nbsp;prior&nbsp;permission&nbsp;of&nbsp;Alibaba&nbsp;Group&nbsp;and/or&nbsp; its&nbsp;affiliates,&nbsp;any&nbsp;person&nbsp;who&nbsp;uses&nbsp;the&nbsp;above&nbsp;content&nbsp;and&nbsp;information&nbsp;without&nbsp;authorization&nbsp;may&nbsp;infringe&nbsp;the&nbsp;rights&nbsp;of&nbsp;Alibaba&nbsp;Group&nbsp;and/or&nbsp;its&nbsp;affiliates,&nbsp;and&nbsp;we&nbsp;will&nbsp;pursue&nbsp;the&nbsp;legal&nbsp;liability&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;infringer.&nbsp;If&nbsp;there&nbsp;is&nbsp;any&nbsp;need&nbsp;for&nbsp;publicity,&nbsp;display,&nbsp;etc.,&nbsp;please&nbsp;be&nbsp;sure&nbsp;to&nbsp;obtain&nbsp;the&nbsp;prior&nbsp;permission&nbsp;of&nbsp;Alibaba&nbsp;Group&nbsp;and/or&nbsp;its&nbsp;affiliates.</span></span></div></div><div data-cangjie-leaf-block="true"><div data-cangjie-key="10" step="" data-type="paragraph" class="sc-cJbhSk kWACbk" style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; line-height: 2.5;"><span><span data-cangjie-key="12:0" data-cangjie-leaf="true" data-testid="12:0" data-cangjie-mark="true" style="font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;">"</span></span><span data-cangjie-key="12:1" data-cangjie-leaf="true" data-testid="12:1" data-cangjie-mark="true" style="font-size: 10pt;">淘宝</span><span><span data-cangjie-key="12:3" data-cangjie-leaf="true" data-testid="12:3" data-cangjie-mark="true" style="font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;">",&nbsp;"Taobao",&nbsp;"</span></span><span data-cangjie-key="12:17" data-cangjie-leaf="true" data-testid="12:17" data-cangjie-mark="true" style="font-size: 10pt;">天猫</span><span><span data-cangjie-key="12:19" data-cangjie-leaf="true" data-testid="12:19" data-cangjie-mark="true" style="font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;">",&nbsp;"Tmall"&nbsp;</span></span><span data-cangjie-key="12:30" data-cangjie-leaf="true" data-testid="12:30"> </span><span><span data-cangjie-key="12:31" data-cangjie-leaf="true" data-testid="12:31" data-cangjie-mark="true" style="font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;">and&nbsp;other&nbsp;words&nbsp;and/or&nbsp;logos,&nbsp;as&nbsp;well&nbsp;as&nbsp;other&nbsp;logos,&nbsp;emblems,&nbsp;product&nbsp;and&nbsp;service&nbsp;names&nbsp;of&nbsp;Taobao&nbsp;and&nbsp;Tmall&nbsp;are&nbsp;trademarks&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;service&nbsp;providers&nbsp;of&nbsp; Taobao/Tmall&nbsp;and/or&nbsp;their&nbsp;affiliates&nbsp;in&nbsp;China&nbsp;and&nbsp;other&nbsp;countries.&nbsp;If&nbsp;you&nbsp;need&nbsp;to&nbsp;use&nbsp;them&nbsp;for&nbsp;publicity,&nbsp;display&nbsp;or&nbsp;other&nbsp;purposes,&nbsp;you&nbsp;must&nbsp;obtain&nbsp;prior&nbsp;written&nbsp;authorization&nbsp;from&nbsp;the&nbsp;mentioned&nbsp;&nbsp;service&nbsp;providers&nbsp;and/or&nbsp;their&nbsp;affiliates.</span></span></div></div><div data-cangjie-leaf-block="true"><div data-cangjie-key="13" step="" data-type="paragraph" class="sc-cJbhSk kWACbk" style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; line-height: 2.5;"><span><span><span data-cangjie-key="15:0" data-cangjie-leaf="true" data-testid="15:0" data-cangjie-mark="true" style="font-weight: bold; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;">Information&nbsp;Restrictions</span></span></span></div></div><div data-cangjie-leaf-block="true"><div data-cangjie-key="16" step="" data-type="paragraph" class="sc-cJbhSk kWACbk" style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; line-height: 2.5;"><span><span data-cangjie-key="18:0" data-cangjie-leaf="true" data-testid="18:0" data-cangjie-mark="true" style="font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;">Without&nbsp;the&nbsp;permission&nbsp;of&nbsp;Alibaba&nbsp;Group&nbsp;and/or&nbsp;its&nbsp;affiliates,&nbsp;no&nbsp;one&nbsp;may&nbsp;conduct&nbsp;address&nbsp;scanning,&nbsp;network&nbsp;port&nbsp;scanning,&nbsp;operating&nbsp;system&nbsp;detection&nbsp;or&nbsp;other&nbsp;scanning&nbsp;and/or&nbsp;detection&nbsp;on&nbsp;Taobao&nbsp;and&nbsp;Tmall&nbsp;websites&nbsp;and&nbsp;their&nbsp;systems,&nbsp;or&nbsp;obtain&nbsp;or&nbsp;use&nbsp;any&nbsp;content&nbsp;of&nbsp;Taobao&nbsp;and&nbsp;Tmall&nbsp;without&nbsp;authorization&nbsp;by&nbsp; monitoring,&nbsp;copying,&nbsp;disseminating,&nbsp;displaying,&nbsp;mirroring,&nbsp;uploading&nbsp;or&nbsp;downloading&nbsp;programs&nbsp;or&nbsp;devices&nbsp;such&nbsp;as&nbsp;robots&nbsp;and&nbsp;spiders.</span></span></div></div><div data-cangjie-leaf-block="true"><div data-cangjie-key="19" step="" data-type="paragraph" class="sc-cJbhSk kWACbk" style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; line-height: 2.5;"><span><span><span data-cangjie-key="21:0" data-cangjie-leaf="true" data-testid="21:0" data-cangjie-mark="true" style="font-weight: bold; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;">Limitation&nbsp;of&nbsp;Liability</span></span></span></div></div><div data-cangjie-leaf-block="true"><div data-cangjie-key="22" step="" data-type="paragraph" class="sc-cJbhSk kWACbk" style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; line-height: 2.5;"><span><span data-cangjie-key="24:0" data-cangjie-leaf="true" data-testid="24:0" data-cangjie-mark="true" style="font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;">Stores&nbsp;and&nbsp;product&nbsp;information&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;Taobao&nbsp;and&nbsp;Tmall&nbsp;platforms&nbsp;(including&nbsp;but&nbsp;not&nbsp;limited&nbsp;to&nbsp;store&nbsp;names,&nbsp;company&nbsp;names,&nbsp;contacts&nbsp;and&nbsp;contact&nbsp;information,&nbsp;product&nbsp;descriptions&nbsp;and&nbsp;instructions,&nbsp;related&nbsp;pictures,&nbsp;videos,&nbsp;etc.)&nbsp;are&nbsp;provided&nbsp;and&nbsp;uploaded&nbsp;by&nbsp;users,&nbsp;and&nbsp;users&nbsp;shall&nbsp;bear&nbsp;the&nbsp;corresponding&nbsp;legal&nbsp;responsibilities&nbsp;for&nbsp;the&nbsp;information&nbsp;they&nbsp;provide&nbsp;and&nbsp;upload.&nbsp;If&nbsp;we&nbsp;have&nbsp;other&nbsp;agreements&nbsp;on&nbsp;this,&nbsp;we&nbsp;will&nbsp;clarify&nbsp;it&nbsp;with&nbsp;you&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;relevant&nbsp;agreement&nbsp;or&nbsp;other &nbsp;legal&nbsp;texts.&nbsp;The&nbsp;works&nbsp;reprinted&nbsp;by&nbsp;Taobao&nbsp;Tmall&nbsp;(including&nbsp;forum&nbsp;content)&nbsp;are&nbsp;for&nbsp;the&nbsp;purpose&nbsp;of&nbsp;conveying&nbsp;more&nbsp;information,&nbsp;which&nbsp;does&nbsp;not&nbsp;mean&nbsp;that&nbsp;we&nbsp;agree&nbsp;with&nbsp;their&nbsp;views&nbsp;or&nbsp;have&nbsp;confirmed&nbsp;the&nbsp;authenticity&nbsp;of&nbsp;their&nbsp;content.</span></span></div></div><div data-cangjie-leaf-block="true"><div data-cangjie-key="25" step="" data-type="paragraph" class="sc-cJbhSk kWACbk" style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; line-height: 2.5;"><span><span><span data-cangjie-key="27:0" data-cangjie-leaf="true" data-testid="27:0" data-cangjie-mark="true" style="font-weight: bold; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;">Intellectual&nbsp;Property&nbsp;Protection</span></span></span></div></div><div data-cangjie-leaf-block="true"><div data-cangjie-key="28" step="" data-type="paragraph" class="sc-cJbhSk kWACbk" style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; line-height: 2.5;"><span><span data-cangjie-key="30:0" data-cangjie-leaf="true" data-testid="30:0" data-cangjie-mark="true" style="font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;">We&nbsp;respect&nbsp;intellectual&nbsp;property&nbsp;rights&nbsp;and&nbsp;oppose&nbsp;and&nbsp;combat&nbsp;intellectual&nbsp;property&nbsp;infringement.&nbsp;If&nbsp;the&nbsp;intellectual&nbsp;property&nbsp;rights&nbsp;holder&nbsp;believes&nbsp;that&nbsp;the&nbsp; content&nbsp;of&nbsp;Taobao&nbsp;Tmall&nbsp;(including&nbsp;but&nbsp;not&nbsp;limited&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;product&nbsp;information&nbsp;posted&nbsp;by&nbsp;users)&nbsp;infringes&nbsp;on&nbsp;their&nbsp;legitimate&nbsp;rights&nbsp;and&nbsp;interests,&nbsp;they&nbsp;can&nbsp;file&nbsp; a&nbsp;complaint&nbsp;through&nbsp;the&nbsp;Alibaba&nbsp;Intellectual&nbsp;Property&nbsp;Protection&nbsp;Platform&nbsp;(</span></span><a target="_blank" href="https://ipp.alibabagroup.com/" class="link" style="text-decoration: underline; padding: 0px 2px;" data-aplus-clk=""><span><span data-cangjie-key="30:397" data-cangjie-leaf="true" data-testid="30:397" data-cangjie-mark="true" style="font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;">https://ipp.alibabagroup.com/</span></span></a><span><span data-cangjie-key="30:426" data-cangjie-leaf="true" data-testid="30:426" data-cangjie-mark="true" style="font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;">).&nbsp;We&nbsp;will&nbsp;handle&nbsp;it&nbsp;in&nbsp;a&nbsp;timely&nbsp;manner&nbsp;in&nbsp;accordance&nbsp;with&nbsp;the&nbsp;relevant&nbsp;laws&nbsp;and&nbsp;regulations&nbsp;and&nbsp;platform&nbsp;rules&nbsp;after&nbsp;receiving&nbsp;the&nbsp;qualified&nbsp;notification&nbsp;from&nbsp;the&nbsp;intellectual&nbsp;property&nbsp;rights&nbsp;holder.</span></span></div></div></div></article></div></div></div></div><div></div><div></div></div> </div></div><div style="display: none;"><div class="contract-reader-page-dialog"><div class="contract-reader-page-dialog-content"><div class="contract-reader-page-dialog-body"></div><div class="contract-reader-page-dialog-footer"><div class="contract-reader-page-button" data-aplus-clk="">确定</div></div></div></div><div class="contract-reader-page-mask"></div></div></div></div>
